    <item>
      <title>AIGC剧变：爱奇艺案例透视生成式AI如何重塑动漫产业与创意边界</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/aigcai-20250913101004719-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 13 Sep 2025 10:10:04 +0800</pubDate>
